# The description of the result of fncall is a word of the language, written or held by a value; in this subset the
# word int (the book, call-receivers). A Structure there describes no result this subset executes -- answer 5.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds the call main().
sub: main () (
    Vars:
        int: x 1
    Body:
        return: x + 1
)
    int: response fncall(Vars Vars Body)
main()
